<section class="editor-page">
  <div class="page-title"><div><h2>Edit profil &amp; role</h2><p>Perbarui identitas dan akses akun @<%= row.username %>.</p></div></div>
  <form class="editor-form" method="post" action="<%= url('account-update') %>" data-saving>
    <input type="hidden" name="csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="<%= row.id %>"><input type="hidden" name="account_version" value="<%= values.account_version || accountVersion(row) %>">
    <div class="form-grid">
      <label>Nama lengkap<input name="name" required maxlength="120" autocomplete="off" value="<%= values.name ?? row.name %>"></label>
      <label>Username<input name="username" required minlength="3" maxlength="80" pattern="[a-zA-Z0-9_.\-]{3,80}" autocomplete="off" value="<%= values.username ?? row.username %>"><small>Huruf, angka, titik, garis bawah, atau tanda hubung.</small></label>
      <label class="full-span">Role<select name="role" required aria-describedby="role-help"><% for(const role of [ROLE,'Administrator']) { %><option value="<%= role %>" <%= (values.role || (row.is_admin?'Administrator':ROLE))===role?'selected':'' %>><%= role %></option><% } %></select><small id="role-help">Pengelola dapat melihat data dan membuat akun; izin edit data diberikan terpisah. Administrator punya akses penuh, termasuk mengubah profil, role, dan mereset password akun lain. Minimal satu administrator harus tetap ada.</small></label>
      <label class="full-span verification-field">Password administrator Anda<input name="current_password" type="password" required maxlength="128" autocomplete="current-password"><small>Konfirmasi menggunakan password akun Anda sendiri. Perubahan username atau role akan mengeluarkan sesi akun yang diedit.</small></label>
    </div><div class="modal-actions"><a class="subtle-button" href="<%= url('accounts') %>">Batal</a><button class="btn primary" type="submit">Simpan profil &amp; role</button></div>
  </form>
</section>
